{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fins of Fortune is a 2D fishing adventure of exploring coves, upgrading your gear, and reeling in a variety of rare and unique fish. Perfect for casual players, it combines simple mechanics with a sense of strategy and timing, rewarding skillful casts and planning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your line and nail the timing for the perfect catch throughout 6 distinct coves. Sell your haul at the fish market to earn coins and upgrade your rod, bait, line, and boat. As you progress, new areas, fish, and upgrades unlock, helping you become the ultimate fisherman.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Catch","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/8a6ee9faaa1a3112df04c75f3e4735cd77b86455.jpg"},{"name":"Triple Star","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/62de63f33a7ce92b766bdd96b92cfe2fba08c73c.jpg"},{"name":"Impressive!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/ee09f15f5269be83d856e9f2621abb568b20262f.jpg"},{"name":"Cove Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/da05bd2704168921230fe088a7ecff11d7400a92.jpg"},{"name":"Cove Conqueror","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/a8ace5c16b1af7c7fe1fbe13b7425aea8aa872d1.jpg"},{"name":"Fish Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/d391cb564f65392f8d300143e980846820a367fe.jpg"},{"name":"Fabled Fisherman","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/8984e46ec1ad99fc6121f1bd673a96dd1fe8006f.jpg"},{"name":"Double Trouble","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4103400/79e0dafc657f22d6c8c6269f1d350575246861a2.jpg"},{"name":"Lucky Streak","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/app